    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d162">

                <pb facs="0339" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg251"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2775: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Brazilian Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Mello Franco</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Chairman of the Commission of Neutrals</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >White</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-11">January 11, 1933</date>.<lb/>[Received 6:33
                        p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In reply to your telegram of the 2nd instant [<hi rendition="#italic">31st
                        ultimo?</hi>],<anchor n="24" xml:id="d162-f1"/> I have the honor to state
                    that the Brazilian Government considers the proposal of your Commission
                    acceptable, and is disposed to collaborate with the states represented therein
                    in any action capable of leading the Governments of Bolivia and Paraguay to
                    reestablish a definitive peace.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Afranio de Mello
                    Franco</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
